  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMECEA - Advancing strategic and sustainable response to cross-border violent conflicts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implemented in the Ilemi Triangle, Karamoja Cluster (Kenya-Uganda-South Sudan-Ethiopia), and Al-Fashaqa (Ethiopia-Sudan border), the project will strengthen peacebuilding structures, gender equity, and climate adaptation strategies to promote sustainable social cohesion by fostering faith-led, community-driven peacebuilding and resilience</narrative>
  </description>
